extracted/
w64devkit*/
winmm_orig.dll

# ---- runtime files that must never be committed ----
files/winmm_orig.dll
files/x64/winmm_orig.dll

# ---- prebuilt binaries are RELEASE-ONLY, never committed ----
# Build them from src/ (see CONTRIBUTING.md) or download the signed release zip.
# Keeping the repo source-only means no opaque/unsigned binaries live in history,
# and the only distributed binaries are the signed, checksummed release assets.
Vastior.exe
files/Vastior.dll
files/winmm.dll
files/x64/Vastior.dll
files/x64/winmm.dll
# (files/Vastior.ini is a text config and IS committed. winmm_orig.dll is
#  generated from the user's own system winmm at install time, never shipped.)
